\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Optimization of the confining potential at fixed throat size and angular momentum. Each CMA-ES proposal starts Newton iteration from a nearby solved candidate; JAX supplies the Jacobian for the GPU solve. Exoticity, the radial screen and constraint penalties feed back into the search; inadmissible or failed solves receive a penalty. Dashed arrows lead to separate resolution and evolution tests. The loop ranks candidates; the subsequent tests assess their reliability.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:search}{{1}{3}{Optimization of the confining potential at fixed throat size and angular momentum. Each CMA-ES proposal starts Newton iteration from a nearby solved candidate; JAX supplies the Jacobian for the GPU solve. Exoticity, the radial screen and constraint penalties feed back into the search; inadmissible or failed solves receive a penalty. Dashed arrows lead to separate resolution and evolution tests. The loop ranks candidates; the subsequent tests assess their reliability}{figure.1}{}}
