\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Search-grid exoticity $X$ against CMA-ES evaluation for D21. Dark and light grey points lie within and above the background-constraint threshold, respectively. The blue step tracks the running minimum; the square marks its first attainment. The inset resolves the late-search plateau. The search minimum is $X=1.785$, compared with $X=1.829$ after finer-grid re-solve (Table~\ref {tab:X}).}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cma}{{2}{3}{Search-grid exoticity $X$ against CMA-ES evaluation for D21. Dark and light grey points lie within and above the background-constraint threshold, respectively. The blue step tracks the running minimum; the square marks its first attainment. The inset resolves the late-search plateau. The search minimum is $X=1.785$, compared with $X=1.829$ after finer-grid re-solve (Table~\ref {tab:X})}{figure.2}{}}
